flowchart TB
    A["体死亡的两条入口"] --> A1["路径 A: close-tmux 端点<br/>kill-window 成功<br/>且 daemon 收割 = absent / not_codex"]
    A --> A2["路径 B: 每小时 / boot 清扫盖戳相<br/>CommDB running 行<br/>且 StateStore 已终态<br/>且 probeRunExecutionLiveness = dead"]
    A1 --> G{"StateStore 状态<br/>是终态吗?<br/>(isMailboxTerminalStatus)"}
    A2 --> G
    G -->|"否 (awaiting_review / design_done 等)"| SKIP1["不盖戳<br/>记 commdb_terminal_stamp_skipped"]
    G -->|"是"| CAS["CommDB.markDeadSessionTerminal<br/>一个 IMMEDIATE 事务:<br/>1. 行存在 且 目标一致 且 非 :pending 且 running<br/>2. UPDATE status/ended_at (CAS)<br/>3. doorbell 置 finished<br/>4. 清 parked 声明"]
    CAS -->|"0 行 / 目标漂移"| SKIP2["零写入<br/>记 skipped(reason)"]
    CAS -->|"成功"| OK["记 commdb_terminal_stamped"]
    OK --> IDX["巡检 owner index 不再列它<br/>MISSING_PANE 消失"]
    OK --> PR["既有清扫 (同轮或下一轮):<br/>窗口探针 dead 且 非 TURN 持有者<br/>=> 按 FLY-2302 规则删行"]
    style CAS fill:#e8f4ff,stroke:#007aff
    style OK fill:#e9f9ee,stroke:#34c759
    style SKIP1 fill:#fff4e5,stroke:#ff9500
    style SKIP2 fill:#fff4e5,stroke:#ff9500
